### PUT – Atualizar cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cliente/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Isaque Santos",
    "telefone": "49888888888"
}

###
### DELETE – Excluir cliente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cliente/{{id}} HTTP/1.1